.TH PURR-INTEGRATE 1 "August 2026" "purr 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
purr-integrate \- KDE Plasma Desktop Integration Manager for Purr
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B purr-integrate
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBpurr-integrate\fR configures opt-in native desktop integrations for \fBpurr\fR (Project Tuki) within KDE Plasma 6.
.PP
Supported integrations include adding Purr to Kickoff Application Launcher favorites, dynamically pinning Purr to Task Manager widgets (Icons-Only and standard Task Managers) via non-destructive in-memory DBus scripts, setting up XDG autostart for the system tray indicator, and launching the background tray monitor.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-all
Enables all desktop integrations in a single step (Favorite, Pin to Task Manager, Tray Autostart, and launches Tray Indicator).
.TP
.B \-\-favorite
Adds Purr to Kickoff Application Launcher favorites.
.TP
.B \-\-unfavorite
Removes Purr from Kickoff Application Launcher favorites.
.TP
.B \-\-pin
Pins Purr to KDE Plasma Task Manager panels without restarting plasmashell.
.TP
.B \-\-unpin
Unpins Purr from KDE Plasma Task Manager panels.
.TP
.B \-\-tray
Starts the Purr System Tray Indicator daemon in the background.
.TP
.B \-\-autostart
Enables automatic startup of the Tray Indicator on user login via \fI~/.config/autostart/purr-tray.desktop\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-autostart
Disables automatic startup of the Tray Indicator on login.
.TP
.B \-\-status
Displays the current status of all KDE Plasma integrations.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR purr (1),
.BR purr-tray (1)
